{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bidmart-admin-wallet-bank-v1",
    "name": "BidMart — Admin Wallet & Bank",
    "description": "Admin-side Wallet, Settlements (Withdrawals), and Bank APIs.\n\nCompanion to docs/admin-wallet-bank-frontend.md.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `base_url` (default: http://localhost:8080/api/v1). Production: https://api.bidmartapp.com/api/v1\n2. Run **🔐 Auth → Admin Login** first — it auto-saves `admin_token` and logs the admin's permissions + super-admin flag (decoded from the JWT) to the Postman console.\n3. For **💰 Wallets**, set `seller_id` (a seller User UUID — get it from `GET /admin/providers`).\n4. For **🏦 Banks → Create**, set `country_id` (get it from `GET /admin/countries`). `bank_id` is auto-saved from Create.\n5. For **💸 Settlements**, run **List** first — it auto-saves the first row's `settlement_id`; all detail/action requests reuse it.\n\n**Seeded super admin:** admin@bidmart.com / Admin@1234\n\n**Notes**\n- All money fields are strings ('450.00').\n- Transaction `amount` is sign-prefixed; debits use U+2212 ('−150.00'), not ASCII '-'.\n- Action endpoints (approve/adjust/reject) are only valid on a `NEW` settlement; re-running returns 409 SETTLEMENT_ALREADY_ACTIONED — the tests accept 200/409/422 so re-runs don't show false failures.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",       "value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "seller_id",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "country_id",     "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bank_id",        "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "settlement_id",  "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('accessToken present', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', b.data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('admin_token saved');",
                  "  try {",
                  "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(b.data.accessToken.split('.')[1]));",
                  "    console.log('is_super_admin:', payload.is_super_admin);",
                  "    console.log('role:', payload.role);",
                  "    console.log('permissions:', JSON.stringify(payload.permissions));",
                  "  } catch (e) { console.log('could not decode JWT payload', e); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@bidmart.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🏦 Banks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A1. List Banks",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('paginated', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "  if (b.data.length && !pm.collectionVariables.get('bank_id')) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('bank_id', b.data[0].id);",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/banks?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "banks"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "countryId", "value": "{{country_id}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "isActive", "value": "true", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A2. Create Bank",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('bank_id saved', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data.isActive).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bank_id', b.data.id);",
                  "  console.log('bank_id:', b.data.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nameEn\": \"Postman Test Bank\",\n  \"nameAr\": \"بنك بوستمان للاختبار\",\n  \"countryId\": \"{{country_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/banks", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "banks"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A3. Update Bank",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nameEn\": \"Postman Test Bank (Updated)\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/banks/{{bank_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "banks", "{{bank_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A4. Toggle Bank Status",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 or 409 (pending settlements)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/banks/{{bank_id}}/toggle-status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "banks", "{{bank_id}}", "toggle-status"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💰 Wallets",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "B1. Seller Wallet Dashboard",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('balances are strings', () => {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.expect(d.balance).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(d.availableForSettlement).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(d.currencyCode).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/wallets/{{seller_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "wallets", "{{seller_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B2. Seller Transactions",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('paginated array', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/wallets/{{seller_id}}/transactions?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "wallets", "{{seller_id}}", "transactions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "type", "value": "SELLER_PAYOUT", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "dateFrom", "value": "2026-01-01", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "dateTo", "value": "2026-12-31", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "referenceNumber", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💸 Settlements",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "C1. List Settlements",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('settlement_id saved (first row)', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  if (b.data.length) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('settlement_id', b.data[0].id);",
                  "    console.log('settlement_id:', b.data[0].id, '| status:', b.data[0].status);",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    console.log('no settlements returned for this filter');",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements?status=NEW&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "settlements"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "NEW" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "dateFrom", "value": "2026-01-01", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "dateTo", "value": "2026-12-31", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C2. New Count (badge)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('count is a number', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.count).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/new-count", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "new-count"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C3. Settlement Detail",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('IBAN is masked', () => {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.expect(d.ibanMasked).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(d.ibanMasked).to.include('*');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/{{settlement_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "{{settlement_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C4. Reveal IBAN (audit-logged)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('full iban returned', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.iban).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/{{settlement_id}}/reveal-iban", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "{{settlement_id}}", "reveal-iban"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C5. Approve Settlement",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 / 409 (already actioned) / 422 (insufficient available)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 409, 422]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('status APPROVED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql('APPROVED'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/{{settlement_id}}/approve", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "{{settlement_id}}", "approve"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C6. Adjust & Approve",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 / 409 / 422', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 409, 422]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('status ADJUSTED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql('ADJUSTED'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"adjustedAmount\": 120.00,\n  \"notes\": \"Partial payout per policy\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/{{settlement_id}}/adjust", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "{{settlement_id}}", "adjust"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C7. Reject Settlement",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 / 409 (already actioned)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('status REJECTED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql('REJECTED'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Invalid bank details\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/settlements/{{settlement_id}}/reject", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["admin", "settlements", "{{settlement_id}}", "reject"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
